{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10295100","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10295100","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1029510001:1":{"text":"우리 가족을 살려주셔서 감사합니다...","source_cn":"感谢你们，及时救了我的亲人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CFE3568EF7736D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029510002:1":{"text":"듀라신이시여. 아이와 어르신 모두 무사하셔서 다행이에요!","source_cn":"艾雅在上，孩子与老人没有受伤就好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6CBBF9B9BCA803B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029510003:0":{"text":"여러분에게 어떻게 보답해야 할지!","source_cn":"真是不知道要怎么感谢你们才好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x824DC83AF6399605","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029510004:1":{"text":"아버지, 이분들은 달의 신의 보물을 찾고 계세요. 어렸을 때 제가 자기 전에 항상 들려주셨던 이야기 있잖아요, 아직 기억하고 계세요?","source_cn":"父亲，他们是为了追寻月神宝藏的传说而来，你还记得给我小...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F0C65ABFD5057D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029510005:1":{"text":"달의 신의 보물을 찾고 계신다고요?","source_cn":"原来如此，各位大人是来寻找月神宝藏的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D4285757CE99535","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1029510005":{"text":"달의 신의 보물을 찾고 계신다고요?","source_cn":"原来如此，各位大人是来寻找月神宝藏的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D4285757CE99535","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029510006:3":{"text":"옛날이야기 들려주시는 거예요? 엄마, 포춘 후르츠를 먹으면서 할아버지 이야기를 듣고 싶어요!","source_cn":"是睡前故事吗？妈妈，我想一边吃赤珠果一边听外公讲！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAAFE9C29ABDDB22A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1029510007:1":{"text":"그래그래, 옛날이야기를 들려주마. 달의 신의 보물은 우리 조상들이 대대로 들려주던 전설이란다.","source_cn":"好吧好吧，我这就讲。月神的宝藏，是我们祖辈留下的一个传...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C0A3F308A6889C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1029510008:1":{"text":"달의 신이 아끼는 물건을 달빛이 반짝이는 샘터 속에 넣어놨다는 이야기야.","source_cn":"传说月神把自己的珍贵之物，放入了可以被月光照亮的泉水之中。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E013582BB3BD178","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1029510009:1":{"text":"달의 신은 귀중한 물건들이 어두운 밤에 너무 반짝여서 다른 사람이 눈독을 들이지 않을까 걱정했어.","source_cn":"但他担心自己珍贵之物在黑夜中太过耀眼，会被他人觊觎。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56A1888BF31876DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1029510010:1":{"text":"그래서 물건을 넣어둔 샘터를 꼭꼭 숨겨놓았단다. 그가 낸 수수께끼를 풀어야만 샘터가 열린다고 하는구나.","source_cn":"于是他将泉眼掩盖起来，只有解开他的谜题才能唤起泉眼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA807937C5F5E60C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1029510011:1":{"text":"신의 수수께끼요? <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 우리가 샘터 주변에서 본 기믹과 관련이 있을까요?","source_cn":"神的谜题嘛？<style=stress><player...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF31EA7910455D29A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"신의 수수께끼요? <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 우리가 샘터 주변에서 본 기믹과 관련이 있을까요?","female":"신의 수수께끼요? <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 우리가 샘터 주변에서 본 기믹과 관련이 있을까요?","variant_male_record_index":"117054","variant_female_record_index":"117055","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1029510012:1":{"text":"이 이상은 저도 잘 모르겠군요!","source_cn":"再多的东西，我也不知道了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6CB1E4B1859BCC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1029510012":{"text":"이 이상은 저도 잘 모르겠군요!","source_cn":"再多的东西，我也不知道了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6CB1E4B1859BCC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1029510013:1":{"text":"행운을 빌겠습니다!","source_cn":"祝你们好运！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16AFC9B97A6B027B","variant_status":"","male":"","fem